<Chapter id="unknowns">
<h2>Open questions</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><code>Frnd/33</code> is defined for an empty page. The generated order for a
    non-empty toon-block entry is unknown.</li>
    <li>The server echo of client <code>Chat/11</code> requires verification.
    Automated validation treats chat as read-only.</li>
    <li><code>Chat/20</code> WhisperUndeliverable has a declared command constant.
    Its inbound type mapping, payload, and boundary remain unresolved.</li>
    <li><code>Prty/0</code> and slot 13 command 50 use observed fixed-size skips.
    Their payload structures remain unresolved.</li>
    <li><code>Toon/23</code> decodes in reflection order for the current capture.
    Its marked layout remains a candidate pending independent confirmation.</li>
    <li><code>Auth/16</code> has the captured GenerateWebToken shape. Related
    generated interfaces also call the same shape GenerateAppToken, so the route's
    preferred semantic name remains ambiguous.</li>
    <li><code>Conference::CategoryDescription</code> contains generated state and a
    generated locator variant outside the simple field-permutation layout model.
    The logical ID, name ID, and sort order are decoded; the generated internals are
    intentionally reported as ignored.</li>
  </ol>
